# Migration artifacts are HASH-BEARING (03-03, D-12): the baseline stamp and
# the drizzle migrator both compute sha256 over the raw bytes of drizzle/*.sql,
# so the committed newline style must be identical on every machine that runs
# them (dev Windows checkout, VPS Linux checkout, tarball deploys). Force LF
# on checkout for exactly these paths — everything else keeps autocrlf behavior.
drizzle/** text eol=lf
scripts/stamp-baseline.mjs text eol=lf
